    "sentence_translations": [
      "Traveling by train",
      "",
      "I travelled to Yunnan by train last month.",
      "Since it would take a long time, I bought a sleeping-car ticket in order to get some sleep during the night.",
      "The beds on the train were all quite narrow but clean.",
      "During daytime, I chatted with other passengers and practiced speaking Chinese.",
      "They were very friendly and taught me many new words.",
      "They also introduced me to a lot of Yunnan’s local culture and customs and we soon became friends.",
      "At first I had one meal in the dining car. However, the food was neither tasty nor cheap.",
      "Later on I instead started to eat instant noodles.",
      "When I was not chatting, I sat beside the window and looked at the scenery outside.",
      "It was really beautiful, especially when we were getting closer to Yunnan, with many mountains and forests.",
      ""
    ]
